<down ref="RM0000016A303GX_03_0078" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000016A303GX_03_0080" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000016A303GX_03_0078" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IPI00000">
<testtitle>Microphone Check (Recording and Playback of Spoken Voice)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Microphone Check (Recording and Playback of Spoken Voice)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E122550J08" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>After pressing the record switch, speak into the microphone and record the voice.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Turn off the air conditioner airflow before performing the inspection. If air is blowing toward the microphone, noise may be included in the recorded voice.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Press the playback switch and check the recorded voice.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>The spoken voice is played back normally without noise, distortion, etc.</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>During playback of the recorded voice, the microphone input level gauge does not respond to the playback sound.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The content spoken during recording is optional.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Recording stops after 5 seconds elapse or when the stop switch is pressed.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>During recording and playback, all switch operations except the stop switch are disabled.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When nothing has been recorded, the playback switch is grayed out.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Playback ends when playback of the recorded content is finished.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
<table>
<title>Text in Illustrations</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.41in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.72in"/>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>*a</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>Microphone Input Level Gauge</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>*b</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>Record Switch</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>*c</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>Stop Switch</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>*d</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>Playback Switch</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>*e</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>Recording Indicator</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000016A303GX_03_0079" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000016A303GX_03_0080" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
